# 2. SPORTS-MARKETING VARIABLE DEFINITIONS
###############################################################################
#
# X1  = recent ticket-purchase intensity
# X2  = merchandise spending propensity
# X3  = digital/app engagement
# X4  = game attendance frequency
# X5  = email/social engagement
# X6  = season-ticket/membership engagement
# X7  = recent purchase recency
# X8  = historical campaign responsiveness
# X9  = game-interest intensity
# X10 = opponent/game attractiveness
# X11 = ticket-price sensitivity
# X12 = fan tenure
# X13-X20 = additional longitudinal behavioral/context variables
#
